    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĕr-aequo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make quite equal</i>
